abstract: >-
  The Sovereign Enterprise AI Control Plane (SEAC-VR) is a vendor-neutral reference architecture and executive operating model designed to decouple enterprise Earnings Quality, reusable institutional IP, and runtime zero-trust governance from underlying frontier foundation model volatility, SaaS seat double-taxation, and IT services effort deflation.
